Package: forestexposurebrazil
Title: Forest Exposure to Degradation Drivers in Brazil, 1986-2022 (analysis compendium)
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Research compendium reproducing the R post-processing (tables,
    statistics and figures) of "Tracking the decline: forest exposure to
    degradation drivers in Brazil" from MapBiomas Collection 9 statistics
    exported from Google Earth Engine.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports: dplyr, tidyr, readr, purrr, ggplot2, patchwork, ggrepel, forcats, here, foreign
Suggests: renv
